<title>SPAIN: Spain 6-mth T-bill yield unchanged at 5.551 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain 6-mth T-bill yield unchanged at 5.551 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p> ISSUE   Yield    Pvs     Price     Pvs     Bid   Allocated</p>
<p> 6-mo     5.551  5.551    97.27    97.27   151.475  126.675</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
